'''Greater demons '''are large [[demonic]] [[monsters]]. They are well known for their [[rune full helm]] and [[Clue scroll (hard)|hard clue scroll]] drops. 

[[K'ril Tsutsaroth]], the [[Zamorakian]] general in the [[God Wars Dungeon]], and his bodyguard [[Tstanon Karlak]]; [[Skotizo]], the [[demi-boss]] in the [[Catacombs of Kourend]]; as well as [[Tormented Demon|Tormented Demons]] are considered greater demons for the purpose of a [[Slayer task]].

A unique [[Greater demon (The Scar)|greater demon]] as well as [[Scarred greater demon]]s can be located in [[The Scar]].

